Jupyter logo (jupyter_logo.svg)
===============================
Dev tree only for SVG + this NOTICE — not shipped in the .oxt (see scripts/build_oxt.py should_exclude).
High-res PNG for README: Showcase/jupyter_logo.png (not in the OXT).

Source: https://github.com/jupyter/design/tree/master/logos/Logo%20Mark/logomark-orangebody-greyplanets
Official Project Jupyter “Planet” logomark (orange crescents + grey moons).
Trademark of Project Jupyter; used to indicate Jupyter notebook import:
https://jupyter.org
https://github.com/jupyter/design (BSD-3-Clause assets)

Regenerate README PNG:
  rsvg-convert -h 512 --background-color=none jupyter_logo.svg -o /tmp/j512.png
  magick /tmp/j512.png -trim +repage PNG32:../../Showcase/jupyter_logo.png
